( CAMEL24 Kit file words; native QEMU I/O ports 8C-8Fh. )
DECIMAL
CREATE (F24STRING) TIBSIZE ALLOT
: (F24SINTERP) 34 WORD COUNT DUP >R (F24STRING) SWAP CMOVE (F24STRING) R> ;
' S" CONSTANT (F24SQ)
: S" STATE @ IF (F24SQ) EXECUTE ELSE (F24SINTERP) THEN ; IMMEDIATE
0 CONSTANT A:
1 CONSTANT B:
2 CONSTANT C:
3 CONSTANT D:
4 CONSTANT E:
5 CONSTANT F:
6 CONSTANT G:
7 CONSTANT H:
8 CONSTANT I:
9 CONSTANT J:
10 CONSTANT K:
11 CONSTANT L:
12 CONSTANT M:
13 CONSTANT N:
14 CONSTANT O:
15 CONSTANT P:
VARIABLE FS-USER 0 FS-USER !
: (F24OK) 142 P0@ ABORT" FILE ERROR" ;
: (F24CMD) 142 P0! (F24OK) ;
: (F24SEND) DUP IF OVER + SWAP DO I C@ 143 P0! LOOP ELSE 2DROP THEN ;
: (F24PATH) ROT DUP 0 16 WITHIN 0= ABORT" DRIVE 0..15" 143 P0! FS-USER @ 143 P0! (F24SEND) ;
: (F24BYTES) TIB OVER 0 DO 143 P0@ OVER I + C! LOOP DROP ;
: (F24LINE) 3 (F24CMD) 143 P0@ DUP IF (F24BYTES) THEN ;
: (F24EVAL) BEGIN (F24LINE) DUP WHILE TIB SWAP EVALUATE REPEAT DROP ;
CREATE (F24TIB) TIBSIZE ALLOT
: (F24OPEN) TIB (F24TIB) TIBSIZE CMOVE 0 142 P0! (F24PATH) 2 (F24CMD) ;
: LOAD (F24OPEN) (F24EVAL) (F24TIB) TIB TIBSIZE CMOVE ;
: SAVE 0 142 P0! (F24PATH) 6 (F24CMD) ;
7 142 P0!
